GAMES

Games made with this engine may be distributed freely: sell them, publish
them, give them away, port them, embed them anywhere. No royalties are owed
to the engine's author, and crediting the author in the game is not required.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUSSIAN ENGINE

Russiano2D is a Russian engine made by a Russian author. If you do not like
that fact, please do not use this engine.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENGINE

You are free to use, modify, distribute, embed and sell this engine and its
parts — with no mandatory royalties and no mandatory attribution.

One request: if you release a game made with it, say thanks to the author.
You do not have to say it out loud. It is not a license condition, it is just
nice.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Third-party components are distributed under their own licenses and are not
covered by this license: SDL3, SDL3_image, SDL3_mixer (zlib), QuickJS-ng,
Box2D, RmlUi, Dear ImGui, trylock/visibility (MIT), glslang and SPIRV-Cross
(Apache-2.0), Material Design Icons (Apache-2.0), Noto Sans and LatoLatin
fonts (SIL OFL). The full list is in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

